  <para style="s1">Paul’s Longing to Visit</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="17" /><char style="w" strong="G80">Brothers</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1161">although</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">we</char> <char style="w" strong="G642">were torn away</char> <char style="w" strong="G575">from</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G4314">for</char> <char style="w" strong="G2540">a short time</char> <char style="w" strong="G5610">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G4383">(in person</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3756">not</char> <char style="w" strong="G2588">in heart)</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1722">[our]</char> <char style="w" strong="G4183">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1939">desire</char> <char style="w" strong="G3708">to see</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4383">face [to face]</char> <char style="w" strong="G4057">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G4704">was even more intense</char>. <verse style="v" number="18" /><char style="w" strong="G1360">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G2309">we wanted</char> <char style="w" strong="G2064">to come</char> <char style="w" strong="G4314">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> — <char style="w" strong="G3303">indeed</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">I</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3972">Paul</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">[tried]</char> <char style="w" strong="G530">again</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G1364">again</char> — <char style="w" strong="G2532">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G4567">Satan</char> <char style="w" strong="G1465">obstructed</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">us</char>. <verse style="v" number="19" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">After all</char>, <char style="w" strong="G5101">who [is]</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">our</char> <char style="w" strong="G1680">hope</char>, <