  <para style="s1">The Return of the Lord</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="13" /><char style="w" strong="G1161">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G80">Brothers</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3756">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G2309">we do not want</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">you</char> <char style="w" strong="G50">to be uninformed</char> <char style="w" strong="G4012">about</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">those who</char> <char style="w" strong="G2837">sleep [ in death ]</char>,<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">4:13 </char><char style="ft">Literally </char><char style="fqa">those who have fallen asleep</char><char style="ft">, as in verses 14 and 15</char></note> <char style="w" strong="G2443">so that</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3076">you will not grieve</char> <char style="w" strong="G2531">like</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3062">rest</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3588">who</char> <char style="w" strong="G2192">are</char> <char style="w" strong="G3361">without</char> <char style="w" strong="G1680">hope</char>. <verse style="v" number="14" /><char style="w" strong="G1063">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G1487">since</char> <char style="w" strong="G4100">we believe</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G2424">Jesus</char> <char style="w" strong="G599">died</char> <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G450">rose again</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3779">we also believe that</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2316">God</char> <char style="w" strong="G71">will bring</char> <char style="w" strong="G4862">with</char> <char style="w" strong="G846">[Jesus]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">those who</char> <char style="w" strong="G2837">have fallen asleep</char> <char style="w" strong="